<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae Industria posts 225 mln esc H1 cons net.</title>
<headline>Sonae Industria posts 225 mln esc H1 cons net.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to June 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net  0.225 vs 0.169 (after minorities)</p>
<p>Note - Sonae Industria, a unit of Portugal's largest industrial group Sonae Investimentos, is a wood products group. It forecast full-year 1996 consolidated net profit of 0.400 billion escudos, compared with 1.1 billion in the same year-ago period.  </p>
<p>    Cons net profit	   1.068 vs 1.637</p>
<p>    Turnover		    32.3 vs 33.6</p>
